4. THE TBD ENTRIES OF THE TOUCHED CONTRACTS, WITH THEIR OWNERS (44)
   IF-BC-PANEL | the ribbon's and the socket's capability above their 1 A maximum for F1's time to trip between 2.0 and 2.2 A (Wurth prints a maximum at laboratory conditions only); effect: a PANEL_5V fault in that band is not shown to stay inside the cable's rating (current.per_conductor) | owner: Layer 6 (Wurth's statement) or the bench (Layer 9)
   IF-BC-PANEL | board C's XFCN BH254VS-26P: no maker sheet read (HC6-SC-7 names it the weakest pick); effect: its contact rating, temperature range and land are not shown | owner: Layer 6 components
   IF-BC-PANEL | the SLOT_EN hold (record l8gnd's keeper U43): DRAFTED, not applied; effect: until applied a panel reset drops every module (slot_power_semantics) | owner: Layer 8 board A (record l8gnd's release)
   IF-AB-RIBBON | SEG-A's buffer U_A at J_AB1 (SC-HF-02, owed on board A); effect: the kit bus's rise time over this ribbon stays HF-F01's until it is drawn | owner: Layer 8 board A (SC-HF-02)
   IF-AB-RIBBON | the SLOT_EN hold (record l8gnd), DRAFTED, not applied; effect: as IF-BC-PANEL's | owner: Layer 8 board A (record l8gnd's release)
   IF-AB-WALL | the ribbon's length (harness.length); effect: its route past board D is not fixed | owner: Layer 7 (ASSEMBLY.md's leads table)
   IF-AB-WALL | W4-F17, A's J_AB2 inside board D's outline (mechanical); effect: the header and its socket do not fit as placed | owner: Layer 7 and Layer 8 board A
   IF-AB-WALL | the bring-up link-speed test (usb); effect: the wall path's achieved speed is not shown | owner: Layer 9 bench (bring-up)
   IF-AD-HARNESS | the 18 AWG lead on the standard VH header: no stated rating (JST VH catalogue page 1); effect: the 5 V lead's contact margin at U23's 2.0 A limit is unproven | owner: Layer 6 (JST's rating) or Layer 7 (a 16 AWG lead)
   IF-AD-HARNESS | a +3V3 fault on board D: no branch limiter, so it is bounded only by board A's +3V3 converter (the TPS62933 at L7) through one 1 A ribbon conductor, its limit not read here; effect: the conductor's rating in that fault is not shown | owner: Layer 8 board A
   IF-AD-HARNESS | S-116, board D's codec under 4.35 V at the lead's 2.0 A peak; effect: the codec's floor at the peak | owner: Layer 8 boards A and D (S-116)
   IF-AC-MAINSW | the lead's length (ASSEMBLY.md's MAIN button row gives none); effect: its route past board B is not fixed | owner: Layer 7
   IF-AE-RF | SMP-MAX and RG-316 power handling at 144 MHz for RF_VHF's 30 W (power_handling); effect: the VHF joint's rating is unproven | owner: Layer 6 components
