   IF-AE-RF | a DC antenna feed on any joint; effect: the arrestors' and the joints' DC rating is not stated | owner: Layer 6 components
   IF-A-PA | the drain current (F-PR-02: 75 to 113 W, uncharacterised); effect: the rail's and the lead's peak basis | owner: Layer 9 bench (F-PR-02)
